01.01
<h3>Seeking God</h3><p><b>Reading:</b> Matthew 6:33</p><p>Begin the day by making room to listen to God. Hurry need not decide your priorities; pause and seek his guidance.</p><p><b>Living it today:</b> Set aside a few quiet minutes before you begin.</p><p><b>Prayer:</b> Lord, guide my decisions and help me listen.</p>
01.02
<h3>Seeking God</h3><p><b>Reading:</b> Psalm 23:1</p><p>Begin the day by making room to listen to God. Hurry need not decide your priorities; pause and seek his guidance.</p><p><b>Living it today:</b> Write down a worry and bring it to God in prayer.</p><p><b>Prayer:</b> Lord, guide my decisions and help me listen.</p>
01.03
<h3>Seeking God</h3><p><b>Reading:</b> James 1:5</p><p>Begin the day by making room to listen to God. Hurry need not decide your priorities; pause and seek his guidance.</p><p><b>Living it today:</b> Listen to someone without interrupting.</p><p><b>Prayer:</b> Lord, guide my decisions and help me listen.</p>
